  "comment": [
    "SHIP config for the Intonalogy brass handoff - identical to",
    "fluidR3-trombone-v2 (the ear-approved build, 2026-08-18: perceptual",
    "gates + tail-margin bar + loudnessEvenness 0.6) but under the",
    "production instrumentKey. Max approved 2026-08-18; attacks keep their",
    "perceptual difference by explicit realism choice (breath support).",
    "See docs/analyzer-perception-handoff.md + decisions.md rounds 10-11.",
    "Rebuild with:",
    "node apps/analyzer/cli/generate-samples.js apps/analyzer/configs/fluidR3-trombone-ship.json --bundle"
  ]
}
